       <div class="match-center"><span class="match-glyph" id="match-glyph" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span class="match-vibe" id="match-vibe">EASY TO START</span></div>
       <div class="match-bottom"><span id="match-tagline">Slow starts. Strong stories.</span><h3 id="match-title">Your first gym chapter</h3></div>
      </div>
      <div class="match-body"><p class="match-intro" id="match-subtitle">New to training? This is your starting point.</p><p class="match-description" id="match-description">Simple workouts, a manageable plan and a little confidence each day.</p><div class="match-action-bar"><button id="pass-match" class="round-action pass" type="button" aria-label="Pass to next fitness match" title="See another fitness match"><span>×</span></button><button id="like-match" class="round-action like" type="button" aria-label="Save this fitness match" title="Save this fitness match"><span>♥</span></button><a id="open-match" class="open-match" href="/start/">Explore <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="swipe-hint" id="match-hint" aria-live="polite">Tap × for next · ♥ to save · or swipe left / right</p></div>
     </article>
    </div>
    <div class="deck-footer"><span id="match-counter">01 / 06</span><div class="progress-dots" id="match-dots" aria-label="Fitness match position"><span class="on"></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><span>ALL FREE ♥</span></div>
   </div>
   <div class="match-side">
    <div class="side-greeting"><span class="mini-heart">♥</span><h3>It's a match… with <em>yourself.</em></h3><p>Fitness isn't about impressing strangers. It's about finding movement you actually want to return to.</p></div>
    <div class="saved-box"><div class="saved-head"><h3>♡ Your likes</h3><small>Private to this device</small></div><ul id="liked-list"><li class="no-likes">Tap the heart to save a fitness idea here.</li></ul><button id="clear-likes" type="button" hidden>Clear saved ideas</button></div>
    <div class="profile-nudge"><div class="nudge-emoji" aria-hidden="true">✦</div><div><strong>Make it personal.</strong><p>A BF card with your nickname and optional Instagram handle — just for this device.</p></div><a href="/join/">Try the card ↗</a></div>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <script type="application/json" id="match-data" set:html={JSON.stringify(matches)}></script>
</section>

<section id="how-it-works" class="how-section wrap" aria-labelledby="how-title">
