 <div class="card-showcase" aria-label="Example BF GYM card preview"><div class="show-card"><div class="show-top"><strong>BF<span>♥</span> GYM <small>GLOBAL</small></strong><small>PREVIEW ONLY</small></div><div class="show-avatar">A</div><div class="show-small">MY FITNESS VIBE</div><h3>Your BF era</h3><p>♡ Starting my fitness journey</p><div class="show-bottom"><span>BF / PERSONAL PREVIEW</span><span>BEST FITNESS ♥</span></div></div><span class="show-sticker" aria-hidden="true">♡ yours, privately</span></div>
</section>

<section class="meet-section wrap" aria-labelledby="meet-title">
 <div class="meet-photo"><img src="/images/trainer/adeep-portrait-new.webp" width="450" height="480" loading="lazy" alt="Coach Adeep Aji, founder of BF GYM Global"/></div>
 <div class="meet-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> SAY HI TO THE FOUNDER</span><h2 id="meet-title">Hi, I'm <em>Adeep.</em></h2><p>I'm a Malayali fitness trainer from Kerala, now living in the UK. I created Best Fitness Gym Global to make everyday fitness less intimidating, more welcoming and easier to explore.</p><p>This is a free fitness-learning space. You don't have to be at any particular fitness level to belong.</p><div class="meet-links"><a href="/trainer/">Meet your coach ↗</a><a href="/ml/kerala-uk/" lang="ml">മലയാളത്തിൽ വായിക്കാം ↗</a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fitwithaadhi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram @fitwithaadhi ↗</a></div></div>
</section>

<section class="explore-footer wrap" aria-label="Explore free BF GYM tools"><h2>Your next move <span aria-hidden="true">♥</span></h2><div class="quick-grid">{quickLinks.map(link=><a href={link.href}>{link.label} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</div></section>
</main>
<footer class="footer"><div class="wrap footer-inner"><div class="footer-brand"><a href="/">BF<span>♥</span> GYM GLOBAL</a><small>Best Fitness · Open to everyone</small></div><div class="footer-links"><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/app/membership/">Member-card concept</a><a href="/kerala-uk/">Our story</a><a href="/ml/kerala-uk/" lang="ml">മലയാളം</a></div><p>BF GYM is an independent fitness-learning site, not a dating service. Fitness 'matches' are curated programme suggestions, not connections between people. Saved likes and profile-card previews remain on your device. There are no live online accounts, public user profiles, payments, or active membership cards.</p></div></footer>
